Spec: Store listing

Purpose:
  Play Store listing texts, screenshots, feature graphics and the foreground-service demo video.

Owns:
  ./play

References:
  /docs/play-store.md
  /tool/tool.sdd

Must:
  Listing texts stay within Play limits: name `30`, short `80`, full description `4000` characters.
  Screenshots and feature graphics are rendered by `/tool/render_store_graphics.sh` from raw shots and HTML frames.
  A visible UI change in a screenshotted screen gets new screenshots before the next production release.
